#EMBEDDED_NOTES
#This dataset shows a completed import of GPS data using the "Import GPS" button on road building screens.   Because GPS angles are produced as outputs, the 64-bit output file format is used.
#
#There are two Procedures that use the GPS imported road data. One is an example of city driving and is named "Follow Short GPS Path" (used in this example).  The second Procedure dataset is "Follow Long GPS Path" which is an import of a section of highway (see: GPS Long Road Import example).
#END_EMBEDDED_NOTES

